          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "folder",
      "name": "Security checks",
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "Have I Been Pwned",
          "url": "https://haveibeenpwned.com/",
          "icon": {
            "type": "emoji",
            "emoji": "🛡️",
            "color": "#0f766e"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "VirusTotal",
          "url": "https://www.virustotal.com/",
          "icon": {
            "type": "emoji",
            "emoji": "🦠",
            "color": "#4338ca"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "IP lookup",
          "url": "https://ipinfo.io/",
          "icon": {
            "type": "emoji",
            "emoji": "🌐",
            "color": "#334155"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "name": "Triage this ticket",
      "prompt": "Read this ticket and give: category, priority (P1 to P4) with the reason, the likely cause, the first 3 troubleshooting steps, and the questions to ask the user if information is missing.",
      "send": true,
      "hands": false,
      "icon": {
        "type": "emoji",
        "emoji": "🎫",
        "color": "#ea580c"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "name": "Reply to the user",
      "prompt": "Draft a friendly, plain-language reply to the person in this ticket: what we found, what they should do next (numbered steps) and when we'll follow up. No jargon.",
      "send": true,
      "hands": false,
      "icon": {
        "type": "emoji",
        "emoji": "💬",
        "color": "#2563eb"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "name": "Is it an outage?",
      "prompt": "Find the official status page for {{ask: Which service? | Microsoft 365}}, open it, and tell me whether there is a known incident: since when, what is affected, and the latest update.",
      "send": true,
      "hands": false,
      "icon": {
        "type": "emoji",
        "emoji": "🚦",
        "color": "#dc2626"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "name": "Write a KB article",
      "prompt": "Turn this solved ticket into a knowledge-base article: title, symptoms, cause, step-by-step fix a non-technical person can follow, and how to prevent it.",
      "send": true,
      "hands": false,
      "icon": {
        "type": "emoji",
        "emoji": "📘",
        "color": "#0f766e"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "name": "Explain this error",
      "prompt": "Explain this error in plain words and list the most likely fixes, most likely first:\n\n{{selection}}",
      "send": true,
      "hands": false,
      "icon": {
        "type": "emoji",
        "emoji": "🧯",
        "color": "#b91c1c"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "name": "Phishing check",
      "prompt": "Look at this email or page for phishing signs: sender and link domains, urgency, mismatched addresses, unexpected attachments and requests for passwords or payment. Give a verdict (likely safe, suspicious, or phishing) and what the user should do. Do not open any of its links.",
      "send": true,
      "hands": false,
      "icon": {
        "type": "emoji",
        "emoji": "🎣",
        "color": "#7c3aed"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "name": "Onboarding checklist",
      "prompt": "Create an IT onboarding checklist for a new {{ask: Role? | Sales}} starting {{ask: Start date?}}: accounts, licences, hardware, access groups, security training and first-day tasks.",
      "send": true,
      "hands": false,
      "icon": {
        "type": "emoji",
        "emoji": "✅",
        "color": "#16a34a"
      }
    }
  ]
}
